#+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
#   Name                   : ebGtJipPayoutJob.scr 
#   Date                   : 17-Jul-2019
#   Description            : Batch
#   Input                  :
#   Output                 :
